      "features": [],
      "notes": [
        "The Edge System is a organically designed solution for both bipolar and monopolar",
        "radio frequency (RF) arthroscopic ablation and coagulation of soft tissue. The Edge",
        "System consists of a generator, (3) bipolar probes and optional wired or wireless",
        "foot controls."
